  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth-JO: Level UP! &#x201c;Capacitating youth with skills for entrepreneurship and employment in agricultural and tourism value chains in Jordan&#x201d;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focusing on enhancing the economic participation of youth and women in Jordan by generating and enhancing the employment prospect for youth and women in the pre- and post-Harvest and Tourism sectors. This will be achieved through work in the supply-match-demand domains of the skills-jobs nexus by implementing technical and soft skills (up) skilling and capacity building programs, demand-supply matching processes, value chain integration, establishing labor market linkages, applying internship models and channeling financial and technical support for self-employment and MSMEs support networks</narrative>
