   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth seeking jobs in agricultural and tourism value chains are capacitated with foundational skills which increase their entrepreneurship or employability prospects. Target is 1500 for the period of 2022-2024, 253 trainees enrolled and completed  the foundational skilling training program by end of December, 2022</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- Review outcomes of the &#x201c;post-harvest&#x201d; and &#x201c;tourism&#x201d; labor market studies commissioned by Nexus Skills-Jobs for Youth Fund
2-  By end of December 2022, 253 trainees enrolled and completed  the foundational skilling training program through online and offline courses. These courses were Life Skills, Financial Literacy and Introduction to Entrepreneurship.</narrative>
   </description>
